flowchart TD
    U[Browser: HTML/CSS/JS Dashboard] -->|multipart upload| A[FastAPI /api/v1/documents/process]
    U -->|GET| B[/api/v1/documents/name/]
    U -->|GET| C[/api/v1/documents list/]

    A --> V[Document Validation Service<br/>type, integrity, page limit]
    V -->|reject| E[Controlled error response]
    V -->|pass| O[OCR / Text Extraction Service<br/>pdfplumber native text + PyMuPDF/Tesseract fallback]
    O --> X[Gemini Extraction Service<br/>Google Gemini vision, structured JSON + evidence]
    X --> F[Financial Validation Service<br/>per document-type formulas, tolerance-based]
    F --> P[(SQLite / Postgres<br/>ProcessedDocument table)]
    P --> A
    B --> P
    C --> P
